GPU Batch Crypto

This project includes selected CUDA cryptographic implementations from the
Smoke project, originally maintained at https://github.com/Topcat-d/Smoke.
Source paths and original SHA-256 hashes are recorded in EXTRACTION.json.
The parent Smoke suite supplies the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Standalone library API, streamed GCM integration, Python bindings, examples,
tests, and packaging were added for this independent extraction in 2026.
Modified imported files are identified by notices in their headers.

Public P-256 table-generation arithmetic and the full-window layout are adapted
from Smoke's gen_p256_comb_table.py and gen_p256_fullwindow_table.py. The public
format uses a generic header. Every checked-in point is independently verified
against cryptography/OpenSSL. These tables contain public curve points only.

Cloudflare and NVIDIA names identify discussion context or tested hardware.
